				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;true&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;1&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/paravastu-sAma/devaH/lokAntaram/brahma-jajJNAnam/&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h1&gt;ब्रह्म जज्ञानम् ...{Loading}...&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ऋक&#34;&gt;ऋक्&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;परचय&#34;&gt;परिचयः&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;AV;S.4.1.1a; 5.6.1a; AVP.5.2.2a; 6.11.1a; SV.1.321a; VS.13.3a; TS.4.2.8.2a; MS.2.7.15a: 96.11; 3.2.6: 23.8; KS.16.15a; 20.5; 38.14a; AB.1.19.1; KB.8.4; ;SB.7.4.1.14; 14.1.3.3; TB.2.8.8.8a; TA.10.1.10a; A;S.4.6.3a; 9.9.12; ;S;S.5.9.5a; 15.3.6; 18.1.2. P: brahma jaj~nAnam TS.5.2.7.1 +++(bis)+++; GB.2.2.6; TB.3.12.1.1; TA.1.13.3; SaMnyAsaU.1; M;S.6.1.7.2; 11.7.3.2; Vait.14.1; 28.33; K;S.17.4.2; Ap;S.16.18.7; 22.3; Kaush.9.1; 15.12; 18.25; 19.1; 28.15; 38.23; 51.7; 79.11; 139.10; JG.2.8,9; BDh.2.10.18.7; BR^ihPDh.9.62,314&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;[कौथुमभाष्ये सायणो &lt;a href=&#34;https://archive.org/details/SamaVedaSanhitaWithSayanabhashyaVolume1SatyavrataSamasrami1874bis_201804/page/n706&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;ust=1542425956410000&#34;&gt;ऽत्र&lt;/a&gt;। तैत्तिरीयब्राह्मणे &lt;a href=&#34;https://archive.org/stream/Anandashram_Samskrita_Granthavali_Anandashram_Sanskrit_Series/ASS_037_Taittiriya_Brahmanam_with_Sayanabhashya_Part_2_-_Narayanasastri_Godbole_1898#page/n229/mode/2up&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;ust=1542425956410000&#34;&gt;अत्र&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://archive.org/stream/taittiriya/taittiriya_brahmana_bhaskara_02#page/n569/mode/2up&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;ust=1542425956411000&#34;&gt;अत्र&lt;/a&gt;। मानसतरङ्गिणीकारो &lt;a href=&#34;https://twitter.com/blog_supplement/status/1062936630602928128&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;ust=1542425956411000&#34;&gt;अत्र&lt;/a&gt;। शुक्रग्रह इत्यन्ये &lt;a href=&#34;https://twitter.com/agnimaan/status/1014886758918512640&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;ust=1542425956411000&#34;&gt;केचित्&lt;/a&gt;, वेनो गन्धर्वःकश्चिद् इति आदित्यो वेति सायणः।]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;ऋक-1&#34;&gt;ऋक्&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;5&#34; unfilled=&#34;&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_yajuH/vAjasaneyam/mAdhyandinam/saMhitA/Rk/vishvAsa-prastutiH/13/03_brahma_jajnAnam.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h6&gt;०३ ब्रह्म जज्ञानम् ...{Loading}...&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ब्र᳓ह्म +++(=मन्त्रः ([सौरमण्डलयज्ञे]))+++ जज्ञानं᳓ +++(=उत्पन्नम्)+++ प्रथमं᳓ पुर᳓स्ताद्&lt;br&gt;&#xA;वि᳓ सीमत᳓स् सुरु᳓चो वेन᳓ &lt;strong&gt;आवः&lt;/strong&gt; ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;स᳓ बुध्न्या᳙ +++(=मूले भवः ([खस्य सूर्यः]))+++ उपमा᳓ अस्य &lt;strong&gt;विष्ठाः᳓&lt;/strong&gt; +++(=विस्थितः)+++,&lt;br&gt;&#xA;सत᳓श्च यो᳓निम् +++(सूर्यम्)+++ अ᳓सतश्च &lt;strong&gt;वि᳓वः&lt;/strong&gt; +++(=विवृतवान्)+++  ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;  &#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;सम-१&#34;&gt;साम १&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;पारम्परिक-गान-मूलम् &lt;a href=&#34;https://archive.org/stream/sAmaveda-jaiminIya-paravastu-paramparA-docs/UDAKA%20SAANTHI%20SAAMAANI%23mode/1up&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;ust=1542425956412000&#34;&gt;अत्र&lt;/a&gt;।&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;रामानुजार्यः 1974 &#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-rAmAnuja/brahma-jajJNAnam-1.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपालार्यः 2015  &#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-gopAla-2015/brahma-jajJNAnam-1.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपाल-विश्वासयोर् अनुवचनम् 2018 1x&#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-anuvachanam-gopAla-vishvAsa-2018/brahma-jajJNAnam-1.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपाल-विश्वासयोर् अनुवचनम् 2018 1.5x&#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-anuvachanam-gopAla-vishvAsa-2018-150p-speed/brahma-jajJNAnam-1.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपालपवनयोर् अनुवचनम् 2015 1x&#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-anuvachanam-gopAla-pavana-2015/brahma-jajJNAnam-1.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपालपवनयोर् अनुवचनम् 2015 1.5x&#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-anuvachanam-gopAla-pavana-2015-150p-speed/brahma-jajJNAnam-1.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ब्र+++([त])+++ह्मा+++(%)+++ ब्रा+++([तः]&amp;ndash;%३)+++अह्मा, ज+++([पो])+++ज्ञा+++(&amp;quot;)+++आनम्।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;प्रथमम् पूरा+++(&amp;ndash;%३)+++स्ता+++(३)+++त+++(v)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;वि+++([त])+++साइ-वा+++([तः]&amp;ndash;%३)+++अइसि,म+++([पो])+++तस् सुरुचो+++([&amp;quot;])+++ओ,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;वॆए+++([&amp;quot;]%)+++ना+++(&amp;ndash;%३)+++ आवा+++(३)+++ह+++(v)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;स+++([त])+++बू+++(%)+++सा+++([तः]&amp;ndash;%३)+++अबुध्न्या+++([&amp;ldquo;पो] &lt;del&gt;ध्या&lt;/del&gt;)+++उपमा+++([&amp;rdquo;])+++आ,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ऽस्यावा+++(-%)+++इ,,ष्ठा+++(३)+++अह+++(v)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;स+++([त])+++तह+++(v)+++ सा+++([तः]&amp;ndash;%३)+++अताह+++(v)+++,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;च+++([पः])+++यो+++([&amp;quot;])+++ऒ,,निम्+असतश्चा वा+++(-%)+++इवा+++(३)+++अह+++(v)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ओ+++([ति]&amp;ldquo;३)+++इ,डा+++([प]&amp;ndash;&amp;ldquo;३)+++अ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;सम-२&#34;&gt;साम २&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;रामानुजार्यः 1974 &#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-rAmAnuja/brahma-jajJNAnam-2.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपालार्यः 2015  &#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-gopAla-2015/brahma-jajJNAnam-2.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपाल-विश्वासयोर् अनुवचनम् 2018 1x&#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-anuvachanam-gopAla-vishvAsa-2018/brahma-jajJNAnam-2.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपाल-विश्वासयोर् अनुवचनम् 2018 1.5x&#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-anuvachanam-gopAla-vishvAsa-2018-150p-speed/brahma-jajJNAnam-2.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपालपवनयोर् अनुवचनम् 2015 1x&#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-anuvachanam-gopAla-pavana-2015/brahma-jajJNAnam-2.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपालपवनयोर् अनुवचनम् 2015 1.5x&#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-anuvachanam-gopAla-pavana-2015-150p-speed/brahma-jajJNAnam-2.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;{हु+++([घॄ])+++वे+++([रॄ]&amp;ldquo;३)+++हा+++(३)+++{अ}इ।}+++([द्विः])+++। ही+++([घू]%)+++षा+++([रॄ]&amp;ndash;%३)+++अया+++(३)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ब्र+++([तै])+++ह्मा जज्ञा+++(&amp;ndash;%३)+++ना, आ+++(v)+++म्+++([रा])+++ प्राथा+++(&amp;ndash;&amp;ldquo;३)+++मम्+++([पी]२)+++ पू+++(&amp;ldquo;३)+++रस्ता+++(&amp;rdquo;)+++त+++(v)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;वि+++([र])+++सीमता+++(-%-३)+++ह+++(v)+++, सू+++([र])+++रूचह+++(v)+++, वे+++([पि])+++ना आवाह+++(v)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;सा+++([र])+++बुध्न्या+++(-%-३)+++ह+++(v)+++, उ+++([र])+++पा+++(%३)+++मा+++(&amp;ndash;%३)+++ अस्या+++(३)+++ विष्ठाह+++(v)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;सा+++([र]३)+++तश्च यो+++(&amp;ndash;%३)+++नी+++([रा]&amp;rdquo;)+++,ईमासा+++(३)+++त+++([पी])+++श्चा+++(&amp;rdquo;)+++ वी+++(%)+++वाह+++(v)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;{हु+++([घॄ])+++वे+++([रॄ]&amp;ldquo;३)+++हा+++(३)+++{अ}इ।}+++([द्विः])+++। ही+++([घू]%)+++षा+++([रॄ]&amp;ndash;%३)+++अहा+++([टृ])+++अअअ औ+++([&amp;ldquo;प])+++हो+++(%३)+++वा+++(३-&amp;rdquo;)+++आ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;{ए+++([पा]&amp;rdquo;)+++ऎ, ऋ+++([पो])+++तम् अमृतम्}+++([द्विः])+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ए+++([पा]&amp;rdquo;)+++ऎ, ऋ+++([टू])+++तम् अमॄ+++(३)+++ता+++(३-&amp;rdquo;)+++अम्॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>मधुश्चुनिधनम्</title>
				<link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/shukraH/paravastu-sAma/madhushchunidhanam/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
