				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;true&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;1&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/paravastu-sAma/devaH/lokAntaram/madhushchunidhanam/&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h1&gt;मधुश्चुनिधनम् ...{Loading}...&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ऋक&#34;&gt;ऋक्&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;RV.8.63.1a; SV.1.355a; AB.5.12.6; KB.23.6; A;S.8.1.14; Svidh.1.4.14; 3.1.10. P: sa pUrvyaH ;S;S.10.8.5.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;+++([सायणो &lt;a href=&#34;https://archive.org/stream/RgVedaWithSayanasCommentaryPart3/rv_sayanabhasya_part3#page/n911/mode/2up&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;ust=1542425956405000&#34;&gt;ऽत्र&lt;/a&gt;। आङ्गीरस ऊरुः। अनुष्टुभ्। इन्द्र इति सायणः, शुक्रग्रह इत्यन्ये &lt;a href=&#34;https://twitter.com/agnimaan/status/1014886758918512640&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;ust=1542425956405000&#34;&gt;केचित्&lt;/a&gt;।])+++&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;स पू॒र्व्यो म॒हानां॑&lt;br&gt;&#xA;वे॒नः क्रतु॑भिरानजे +++(=प्राप्नोति)+++ ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;यस्य द्वारा मनु॑ष् पि॒ता&lt;br&gt;&#xA;दे॒वेषु॒ धिय॑ +++(=कर्माणि)+++ आन॒जे +++(=प्राप)+++।।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/classes/lokAntaram/images/venus_morning_star.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/classes/lokAntaram/images/venus_morning_star.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;सम&#34;&gt;साम&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;पारम्परिक-गान-मूलम् &lt;a href=&#34;https://archive.org/stream/sAmaveda-jaiminIya-paravastu-paramparA-docs/VIVAAHA%20UPANAYANA%20SAAMAANI#page/n2/mode/1up&#34;&gt;अत्र&lt;/a&gt;। कौथुमगानम् &lt;a href=&#34;https://archive.org/details/SamaVedaSanhitaWithSayanabhashyaVolume1SatyavrataSamasrami1874bis_20180